{"data":{"content":"All tests pass. Here's a summary:\n\n---\n\n### Bug\nIn `chunks.mjs`, the `slice` call used `size` as the end index instead of `index + size`:\n```js\n// Before (buggy)\nresult.push(values.slice(index, size));\n\n// After (fixed)\nresult.push(values.slice(index, index + size));\n```\n`Array.prototype.slice(start, end)` takes an **absolute end index**, not a length. Without adding `index`, every iteration sliced from the beginning of the array up to `size`, producing wrong (and shrinking) chunks.\n\n---\n\n### Test results — exit code `0`\n\n| Metric | Count |\n|---|---|\n| tests | 4 |\n| pass | **4** |\n| fail | 0 |\n| cancelled / skipped / todo | 0 |","elapsed_ms":4851,"first_token_ms":923,"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","provider_context":{"model_id":"claude-sonnet-4-6","profile_id":"claude","profile_revision":2,"provider":"anthropic","route_id":"anthropic.messages","wire":"anthropic-messages"},"provider_items":[{"content_json":"[{\"text\":\"All tests pass. Here's a summary:\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Bug\\nIn `chunks.mjs`, the `slice` call used `size` as the end index instead of `index + size`:\\n```js\\n// Before (buggy)\\nresult.push(values.slice(index, size));\\n\\n// After (fixed)\\nresult.push(values.slice(index, index + size));\\n```\\n`Array.prototype.slice(start, end)` takes an **absolute end index**, not a length. Without adding `index`, every iteration sliced from the beginning of the array up to `size`, producing wrong (and shrinking) chunks.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Test results — exit code `0`\\n\\n| Metric | Count |\\n|---|---|\\n| tests | 4 |\\n| pass | **4** |\\n| fail | 0 |\\n| cancelled / skipped / todo | 0 |\",\"type\":\"text\"}]","finish_reason":"stop","provider_finish_reason":"end_turn","type":"anthropic_content"}],"usage":{"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"completion_tokens":204,"input_tokens":10256,"input_tokens_scope":"uncached","output_tokens":204,"prompt_tokens":10256,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}